  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">mSCAN offers portable ultrasound probes that can work on a laptop, tablet/phone to deliver ultrasound on the go. We leverage on the portability and low power consumption of our devices to deliver ultrasound in rural areas where there is limited access to power and access to quality health care.</narrative>
